  "comment": [
    "D-SINK-19 round 14, R24a (D-SRC-22): Model.mergeForeignState(base, ours, theirs), the three-way merge of a FOREIGN",
    "write (a hand-run helper verb, a restore) into a session that holds a change the file does not. One case per field",
    "rule, per conflict and per identity. tests/Model.test.js runs every case through the shipping function, and checks",
    "the two identities over EVERY case as well: merge(base, base, theirs) is theirs and merge(base, ours, base) is ours.",
    "A state here is shorthand the test expands: a record is {k, label, lastUsed} and becomes a full record with a URL",
    "derived from its key (labelCustom true, so the label is kept as written); a recent, lastPlayed or session is a",
    "channel id. `want` is a projection of the result: records as key:label:lastUsed, recents and the session as ids,",
    "and conflicts as field or sources:key. A missing field is the empty state's."
  ],
